WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:12.312
&gt;&gt;&gt; WITH LESS THAN TWO MONTHS
UNTIL THE MID-ELECTIONS, NOT ALL

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:17.984
ADS HAVE BEEN ACCURATE.
