ONE.

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:20.106
&gt;&gt; DEFUNDING THE POLICE IS WAY
OFF THE MARK.

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:24.577
WE NEED MORE COPS, NOT LESS.
&gt;&gt; THE CAMPAIGN SENT ME A

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:28.615
