&gt;&gt; I HEARD THE DOOR SLAM

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:56.442
DOWNSTAIRS AND I KNEW SOMEBODY
WAS IN OUR HOUSE.

00:02:56.442 --> 00:03:00.947
THE GIRLS WERE VERY UPSET.
I STARTED CRYING BECAUSE I WAS

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:04.417
